  "description": "BaiqiSoft Barcode Label Printing SDK for .NET 4.0  (Based on .NET 4.0, compatible with .NET 4.5+)\n\nIt allows you to integrate the barcode label design and printing functionality into your .NET applications with a few steps. You can  use the  user-friendly  interfaces to design the label templates or create the label layouts yourself in C#  or VB.NET. All labels and forms are printed immediately  with data  supplied  by your application.\n\nDemo project with source code is available at http://www.mysofttool.com/net-print-barcode-label-control\nOnline documentation is available at https://www.mysofttool.com/help/labeldesign/\n\nFor more details, please visit http://www.mysofttool.com/net-print-barcode-label-control",
